{
  "story": {
    "name": "Embergloom",
    "premise": "The kingdoms magic is dying, stolen by a hidden ritual that binds a mages life to the land. Elis father was the last sacrifice. Armed with a journal that maps his fathers unraveling and a vial of luminous elixirs, Eli hunts for proof the Crown is lying. When he discovers his father is still alive, chained beneath the throne, his heartbeat feeding the crops, Eli faces an impossible choice: sever the bond and watch the kingdom starve, or let his father rot to feed strangers and become the next living sacrifice himself.",
    "tone": "wry and melancholic",
    "themes": [
      "Legacy",
      "sacrifice",
      "loneliness",
      "trust",
      "shared burden"
    ],
